Package: nbabetting
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian NBA Betting Model with DunksAndThrees Integration
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", email = "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive Bayesian betting model for NBA games that generates
    probability distributions for spreads, totals, team totals, and moneylines.
    Integrates DunksAndThrees adjusted efficiency data with internal tempo tracking,
    weighted rotation analysis, and Monte Carlo simulation. Implements exponential
    decay weighting (15-game half-life) for recent performance, lineup impact
    adjustments using player EPM values, and venue-specific effects.
